    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis exceptional property presents a rare opportunity to acquire a turn-key 4 bed, 3 bathroom family home. Set on an unusually large and beautifully maintained 1.3 acre (approx.) site, this impressive two-storey dwelling has been finished to a high standard. Designed for modern living, the home seamlessly blends spacious, light-filled interiors offering the perfect sanctuary for a growing family. Situated just 3km from the N69, offering fast and easy access for daily commuters while the heritage town of Listowel is a mere 7-minute drive (5.9km) with a choice of shops, restaurants, schools, clubs, greenway etc. Ballybunion with his world famous golf links and blue flag beaches is a 15 minute drive. Ground floor accommodation comprises entrance hallway, living room, large open plan kitchen/dining/living room which opens into the sun room, utility room, plant room, a flexible room ideal for remote working or guest accommodation and w/c. On the first floor there are three double bedrooms (master ensuite), a walk in wardrobe and family bathroom. There is stira stairs to the attic for additional storage needs. The property was completed in 2018 and features oil fired zoned heating, solid fuel stove, power showers and onsite septic tank. Viewing of this fine property is a must and is strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.82m x 2.35m\nwith porcelain floor tiles and a steel & wood feature staircase.\n\nLiving Room - 4.44m x 3.88m\nwith a solid fuel stove and a brick chimney breast, wood effect laminate flooring & two windows.\n\nKitchen/Dining/Living - 9.78m x 3.74m\nLarge open plan kitchen with fitted units and integrated appliances, wall & floor tiles, two windows and sliding door leading to rear garden. This room opens into the sun room.\n\nSun Room - 3.97m x 3.59m\nwith wood effect laminate flooring & four windows providing an abundance of natural light.\n\nUtility Room - 3.15m x 2.36m\nwith tiled flooring, shelving and plumbed for appliances, window and door leading to rear garden.\n\nPlant Room - 1.39m x 1.34m\n\n\nOffice/4th Bedroom - 3.28m x 2.37m\nwith laminate flooring & window.\n\nW/C - 1.93m x 1.76m\nwith w/c, whb, wall & floor tiles.\n\nLanding - 5.71m x 2.20m\nwith laminate flooring, stira to attic & window.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.90m x 3.45m\nDouble with laminate flooring & window.\n\nEnsuite - 2.72m x 1.64m\nwith pumped shower, wall & floor tiles, whb with vanity unit, w/c & window.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.82m x 3.72m\nDouble with laminate flooring & window.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.87m x 3.44m\nDouble with laminate flooring & window.\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - 2.37m x 1.88m\nwith shelving, laminate flooring & window.\n\nFamily Bathroom - 3.32m x 2.91m\nwith an electric pumped shower, corner bath, whb with vanity unit, w/c, wall & floor tiles and window.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>4 bedroom, 3 bathroom detached family home in turn key condition.</li><li>An excellent B BER rating </li><li>Pumped showers & zoned heating</li><li>Large landscaped site (1.03 acre approx.)</li><li>Onsite septic tank, Mains water Supply.</li><li>Fibre broadband available</li><li>CCTV cameras installed</li><li>Excellent location -- m from the N69</ul>"
      },
